条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。居民养老、居民医保可以自己按年交。职工社保断了，不必为了「别断档」去花钱找人挂靠。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["基本养老保险按累计缴费年限算，中间断过也不清零。到法定退休年龄，累计满 15 年就能按月领养老金。不够的，可以接着缴到满 15 年。换个地方就业的（正式说法是跨统筹地区），养老关系跟着人走，缴费年限接着往上累计。职工医保累计缴费达到国家规定年限的，退休后不用再交。居民医保断缴的代价是等待期：重新交上之后，有一段时间看病不给报（居民医保见第 9 条）（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2010, 2018 修正). 社会保险法（第十六、十九、二十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/guoqing/2021-10/29/content_5647616.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/guoqing/2021-10/29/content_5647616.htm"]},"；国务院办公厅 (2024). 关于健全基本医疗保险参保长效机制的指导意见（国办发〔2024〕38 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202408/content_6965741.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202408/content_6965741.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["职工医保退休不用再交的那个年限，法律写的是「国家规定年限」，各地执行的数不一样，男女也常常不同，打 12393 或者问参保地医保局。断缴主要影响当地那些要求连着交满多少个月的资格，比如买房、落户、积分，这些规则各地自己定，去当地查。花钱找人「挂靠」代缴，钱可能打水漂，也有法律风险，不建议。换城市工作时养老和医保关系怎么转、别办退保，见第 19 节第 19 条（养老和医保关系转到新参保地）。15 年这条线 2030 年起每年提高 6 个月，逐步到 20 年，自己交怎么算账见第 5 节第 46 条（自己交职工养老保险）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/07-17"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"把住和吃压到最低：合租月租代替日租，自炊和助餐食堂代替外卖"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/07-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"坐过牢、破过产、上过失信名单，法律上都有重来的路，先把手续走完"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["求职别只投简历，用系统方法：学技巧、定目标、找人帮"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["参加过求职辅导的人，找到工作的几率是没参加的人的 2.67 倍。管用的是这几样：学具体的求职技巧，把自己讲清楚，定明确目标，主动出击，开口找人帮忙。找人帮忙落到…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不交押金、不押证件、不签「培训贷」、不进传销、不借高利贷"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["用人单位不能扣你的身份证，不能收押金，也不能换个名目收钱。中介没给你介绍成工作，必须退中介费。先交培训费再上岗的培训贷、靠拉人头算钱的传销，都是官方点名的骗局。…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-16"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["住房困难先排公租房"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["要同时占上三条：在本地没房，或者住房面积低于标准；收入和财产低于标准；外来务工的还要在本地稳定就业满规定年限。轮候期由当地公布。这是远水，解不了近渴，但排队不花…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["大病之前，基本医保之外配一份一年期医疗险或重疾险，看清「保证续保」四个字"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这类保险补的是医保报完之后你自己要掏的那部分，还有停工的损失。买之前认准「保证续保」四个字：没有这四个字的，明年可能停售或者涨价。健康状况要如实告知，瞒了会被拒…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-21"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["实在没地方睡，24 小时营业场所只能应急一晚，优先去救助站"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["机场、火车站的候车区能撑一夜，有厕所也有电源，但没有官方数据说这样安全。救助站有人 24 小时值班，夜里上门也会先救助。冬天有的地方还开临时避寒场所。不想进站的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-22"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["被欠了工钱，先分清雇你的是谁：没执照的作坊和包工头照样找劳动监察，给家庭或个人干私活才去法院"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["没办执照的作坊、店铺